  era: "Mesolithic onwards \xB7 Section 1 \xB7 Prehistoric India \xB7 c. 1.5 million years ago \u2013 700 BCE"
  title: Rock art
  text: The rock shelters of Bhimbetka in Madhya Pradesh, a UNESCO World Heritage Site, hold thousands of paintings, the earliest probably from the Mesolithic. Painted mostly in red and white, they show hunting, dancing, animals and scenes of daily life.
